=== intro

A message comes through on a Guild frequency—addressed to you specifically.

"Captain. You pulled my cousin out of the black three cycles back. The family doesn't forget. Coordinates attached—a cache we stashed before the Consortium found our operation. It's yours."

A gift from grateful smugglers. The coordinates check out.

* [Collect the cache]
  ~ credits += 80
  ~ chronicle "Debt Repaid"
    Collected a reward for a past rescue. Good deeds echo through the void, sometimes.
  -> END

* [Ignore it—could be a trap]
  ~ chronicle "Caution"
    Ignored a supposed reward. Trust is expensive out here.
  -> END
